   $q$What can the reader infer from the rule about borrowing the power drill?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The drill is the most expensive object in the library's whole collection.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The library plans to stop lending the drill once the classes are finished.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The library wants borrowers to know how to use risky tools safely before taking them home.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The builder owns the drill and lends it only to people he has already met.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The library wants borrowers to know how to use risky tools safely before taking them home.$q$, $q$The class teaches "using the power drill safely," and only people who finish it may borrow the drill, which points to a concern for safety. The text gives no prices, so a claim about cost is not supported.$q$, 'draft', '45f04a83-56d8-5722-a194-2c4001a1fa2b')
