   $q$According to the passage, how does a lodge help protect beavers?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Its underwater entrances help keep predators out.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It floods nearby roads so that people stay away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"It is built on dry land far from the stream.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Its trunks are wrapped in wire to stop chewing.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-details"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Its underwater entrances help keep predators out.$q$, $q$Paragraph 1 says the lodge's "underwater entrances help keep predators out." Wire is wrapped around valuable trees by people, not around the lodge.$q$, 'draft', '0f15e3de-08ef-5e31-bf53-4231f29ae673')
